 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Azami Yako wo Suki ni naru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "I will fall in love with Azami Yako"
   },
   {
    "ja": "アザミヤコを好きになる"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "It's his first day after transferring to a new school. In front of his new classmates, wearing a poker face, Sannomiya Makoto, a highschool boy, introduces himself.\n\nHe's there because there's a female student he absolutely has to meet—\nAzami Yako, the daughter of a CEO, and also his fiancé!\n\nHe's seen a picture of her from middle school, and now their meeting in real life is seconds away!\n\nThe veil over her is removed to reveal...\n\nA slob who doesn't know how to eat properly, has messy hair, mumbles to herself constantly, and is just all around suspicious!"
  },
